  "description": "Various secrets are uploaded anonymously every day in the school's anonymous application.\nMin-Jun, who is in love with Ha-young unrequitedly for 10 years, has all the anonymous posts appearing as real names due to an error and finds out the shocking fact that Ha-young's boyfriend 'Ki-ju' is cheating.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated and edited)",
